      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey i think im losing it but the lights are doing that weird stutter thing again and i can actually feel it... like there is this weird humming pressure in my head every time they flicker. it feels like the frequency is actually vibrating inside my ears or something. is it possible they are using these sub-audible frequencies to interact with me directly or like scan my brain waves while they do the light thing? i feel so exposed right now.",
